[plugininstall]
description=Fast, lightweight Markdown renderer (Direct2D/DirectWrite). Self-contained ZIP: bundles the shared wlx-listerine-core.dll, themes and grammars alongside the markdown plugin. Installs into the same folder as the sibling colorizer plugin (TC will offer to overwrite shared files).
type=wlx
file=wlx-listerine-md.wlx64
defaultdir=wlx-listerine
